audio:
  lang: en
  lines:
    '|a||You look as if… in Russian: как будто, словно':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ты выглядишь так, как будто не спал: say how someone looks in Russian with выглядеть, как будто, будто and словно.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:16rsib4'
    '|a||Октя́брь. Ве́чер, ку́хня «Невы́». Ма́ша прихо́дит ко мне на рабо́ту.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6040
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:mr0rfh'
    '|b||Том, ты вы́глядишь так, как бу́дто не спал неде́лю!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3560
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:fpqb5c'
    '|a||Почти́ не спал. Учу́ слова́ для экза́мена.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||У тебя́ бле́дное лицо́. Ты голо́дный?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3440
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Нет. Я про́сто уста́л. И я не́рвный пе́ред экза́меном.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Ты говори́шь так серьёзно, сло́вно экза́мен за́втра!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3960
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Не смешно́! Экза́мен че́рез неде́лю.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3280
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||How does Tom look? (как бу́дто = as if)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Как бу́дто не спал неде́лю.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Why is Tom so tired?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Учу́ слова́ для экза́мена.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||When is the exam?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Че́рез неде́лю.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Посмотри́те. Ты вы́глядишь так, как бу́дто не спал неде́лю!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4400
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Как бу́дто: as if. По́сле как бу́дто — a whole clause with its own verb: не спал.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:12te9g'
    '|a||English says as if you hadn''t slept; Russian doesn''t need бы: it just keeps the ordinary past.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:bh9aa'
    '|a||Вы́глядеть: to look. Я вы́гляжу, ты вы́глядишь, он вы́глядит. The stress stays on вы́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:10vzinu'
    '|a||Ма́ша: у тебя́ бле́дное лицо́. Лицо́: face. Бле́дный: pale.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1u90qec'
    '|a||Том: я уста́л. That''s how you say I''m tired. From уста́ть: уста́вший, tired, mostly before a noun: уста́вшее лицо́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1oi2pgy'
    '|a||И не́рвный: nervous. Я не́рвный пе́ред экза́меном.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:w6s1pk'
    '|a||Ма́ша спра́шивает: ты голо́дный? Голо́дный: hungry.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ueot1m'
    '|a||Вы́глядеть: how do you look? Here are four common ways to say it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1wokx4o'
    '|a||Как? An adverb: ты хорошо́ вы́глядишь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:150fdgj'
    '|a||Very often an adjective with the with-ending: он вы́глядит серьёзным. Серьёзный: serious; ты говори́шь серьёзно: seriously.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:yt9h0u'
    '|a||Как and a noun: он вы́глядит как студе́нт. Like a student.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1giokc0'
    '|a||Как бу́дто and a whole clause: ты вы́глядишь так, как бу́дто не спал.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1x99bga'
    '|a||Так before it is common, but you may leave it out: ты вы́глядишь, как бу́дто не спал.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:4i128g'
    '|a||Ма́ша шу́тит: ты говори́шь так серьёзно, сло́вно экза́мен за́втра!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:12uf6k0'
    '|a||Сло́вно means the same as как бу́дто, but it''s bookish; in talk it sounds a little playful.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:4wi59x'
    '|a||А э́то: говоря́т, бу́дто экза́мен о́чень тру́дный.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:7b0u8y'
    '|a||Бу́дто alone, after говоря́т or ка́жется, usually adds a doubt: people say so, but is it true?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:zplul6'
    '|a||И Том: не смешно́! Смешно́: funny.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ydeay6'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Вы́берите.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:hm1k0r'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1fojaw2'
    '|a||Ты хорошо́ вы́глядишь!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Он вы́глядит как настоя́щий шеф.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1oln5uh'
    '|a||Со́фья рабо́тает так, как бу́дто она́ здесь шеф.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:17rwcfz'
    '|a||Ка́жется, бу́дто все уже́ зна́ют. Молоде́ц!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:fa1jul'
    '|a||На сле́дующий день. По́сле диало́га нажми́те Practise, and be Tom.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:affr68'
    '|a||Напиши́те: He speaks as if he knows everything.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:11l1mti'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Он говори́т так, как бу́дто всё зна́ет.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Шесть вопро́сов.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Экза́мен ско́ро, и я мно́го учу́. Ве́чером я иду́ домо́й, а у две́ри — сосе́дка, Ни́на Петро́вна. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:19zvpei'
    '|b||Том, вы вы́глядите так, как бу́дто весь день не обе́дали.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4560
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:wf3917'
    '|a||Е́сли че́стно, я о́чень голо́дный. Весь день учи́л слова́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Приходи́те ко мне: у меня́ есть суп и пиро́г.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Спаси́бо! Вы всегда́ зна́ете, что мне ну́жно.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||How does Tom look to his neighbour Ни́на Петро́вна?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Как бу́дто весь день не обе́дали.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What does Ни́на Петро́вна, Tom''s neighbour, offer him?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Суп и пиро́г.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Вы́берите.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ма́ша вы́глядит как студе́нтка.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Том говори́т так, как бу́дто экза́мен за́втра.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:11usb8m'
    '|a||Говоря́т, бу́дто экза́мен о́чень тру́дный.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1eqth68'
    '|a||«Говоря́т, бу́дто экза́мен о́чень тру́дный.» What does бу́дто add?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1iyczn5'
    '|a||A doubt.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Ты вы́глядишь так, как бу́дто не спал.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Напиши́те: Masha looks as if she knows everything.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Ма́ша вы́глядит так, как бу́дто всё зна́ет.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||6 из 6.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2040
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Хорошо́, серьёзным, как студе́нт, как бу́дто не спал: four ways to say how someone looks.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:yzkpzz'
    '|a||А я? Сего́дня я сплю. Сдава́ть экза́мен мне уже́ ско́ро.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:8vfe6e'
    '|a||Да́льше: I''m afraid that…':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ma7y8j'
    '|a||Ма́ша: как бу́дто не спал неде́лю.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3280
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Том: учу́ слова́ для экза́мена.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Экза́мен че́рез неде́лю, а не за́втра.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3040
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Он говори́т так, как бу́дто всё зна́ет: как бу́дто and a whole clause.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Вы вы́глядите так, как бу́дто весь день не обе́дали.':
      mp3: 
